# Zimone, All-Questioning with Doubling Season: its end-step trigger creates two Primos, and "then put that many +1/+1
# counters on it" puts them on both as one event (CR 608.2c, 101.4) - two lands, doubled to four each. Both Primos are Heroes
# by Arcane Adaptation, so Invisible Woman, Sue Storm ("whenever you put one or more +1/+1 counters on one or more other
# Heroes you control") triggers once, not once a Primo. The legend rule keeps one Primo before the trigger is put on the
# stack; the stack then holds that one trigger, and accepting it makes two Walls (doubled).

